WOOF-THROWING-DISPOSE | Warning | (10,12--11,18) | Throwing exception with 'reraise' in Dispose method is an anti-pattern. Exceptions thrown from Dispose can cause issues in 'using' blocks, finalizers, and disposal chains. Consider catching and logging the exception instead of rethrowing it.
WOOF-THROWING-DISPOSE | Warning | (18,12--19,18) | Throwing exception with 'reraise' in Dispose method is an anti-pattern. Exceptions thrown from Dispose can cause issues in 'using' blocks, finalizers, and disposal chains. Consider catching and logging the exception instead of rethrowing it.
